      "source": "For convenience, implementations can use the provided static helper methods such as\n<a href=\"../filter/converter/AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.html#emitJsonValue(java.lang.Object,java.lang.StringBuilder)\"><code>AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.emitJsonValue(Object, StringBuilder)</code></a> for JSON-based filters,\n<a href=\"../filter/converter/AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.html#emitLuceneString(java.lang.String,java.lang.StringBuilder)\"><code>AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.emitLuceneString(String, StringBuilder)</code></a> for Lucene-based filters, or\nimplement their own format-specific escaping logic as needed.",
      "translation": "为方便起见，实现可以使用提供的静态辅助方法，例如针对基于 JSON 的过滤器使用<a href=\"../filter/converter/AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.html#emitJsonValue(java.lang.Object,java.lang.StringBuilder)\"><code>AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.emitJsonValue(Object, StringBuilder)</code></a>，针对基于 Lucene 的过滤器使用<a href=\"../filter/converter/AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.html#emitLuceneString(java.lang.String,java.lang.StringBuilder)\"><code>AbstractFilterExpressionConverter.emitLuceneString(String, StringBuilder)</code></a>，或根据需要实现其自身的特定格式转义逻辑。",
